            = succeed ")," do
              %a{:href => "#CastellaniDAuriaFre"} Castellani-D’Auria-Fré
          %p Below we work out the following:
          #RealSpinRepresentations.num_prop
            %h6#proposition_3 Proposition
            %p
              Let
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi V
                    %mo =
                    %msup
                      %mi ℝ
                      %mrow
                        %mi d
                        %mo −
                        %mn 1
                        %mo ,
                        %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} V = \mathbb{R}^{d-1,1}
              be
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Minkowski+spacetime"} Minkowski spacetime
              of some
