          %p One defines the following operations on these real algebras:
          #Conjugation.num_defn
            %h6#definition_22 Definition
            %p
              For
              = succeed "," do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi 𝕂
